<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 1080px; padding: 18px 24px 20px; gap: 14px">

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge); padding-bottom: 12px">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
      <div style="font-size: 26px">The Crowd</div>
      <div class="note">
        The panel docks to the right of any screen. Everything it does happens in this session only &mdash;
        no shared economy, no channel points, no money on a fight.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-grow: 1"></div>
    <div class="chip" style="min-width: 150px">
      <div class="fig" style="color: var(--good)">Live</div><div class="cap">twitch</div>
      <div class="trend">as yilkgames</div>
    </div>
    <div class="chip" style="min-width: 150px">
      <div class="fig" style="color: var(--muted)">Off</div><div class="cap">kick</div>
      <div class="trend">not linked</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-grow: 1; min-height: 0">

    <!-- who is in the pool, and on whose terms -->
    <div class="panel" style="width: 500px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
      <div class="sec">The pool</div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px">
        <div class="chip" style="min-width: 0; flex-grow: 1"><div class="fig">214</div><div class="cap">in the pool</div></div>
        <div class="chip" style="min-width: 0; flex-grow: 1"><div class="fig">9</div><div class="cap">opted out</div></div>
        <div class="chip" style="min-width: 0; flex-grow: 1"><div class="fig">31</div><div class="cap">asked to go up</div></div>
        <div class="chip" style="min-width: 0; flex-grow: 1"><div class="fig">4</div><div class="cap">names refused</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="note">
        Anybody who has spoken is in. <span style="color: var(--ink)">!no</span> takes a viewer out and
        keeps them out; <span style="color: var(--ink)">!join</span> only asks to be drawn sooner.
        Four names were held back by the word filter and never entered the pool.
      </div>

      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div class="sec">The next man off the mat</div>
      <div class="card" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; border-color: var(--heading)">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 2px; background: #1a1d26; border: 1px solid var(--indigo); flex: none"></div>
        <div style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; min-width: 0">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between">
            <span style="color: var(--heading)">takeshi_nine</span><span class="note">drawn at random</span>
          </div>
          <div class="note">Will step on the mat as <span style="color: var(--ink)">Takeshi</span> &mdash; rename him before he does.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="btn" style="flex: none">Rename</div>
      </div>
      <div class="note">
        With nobody in the pool the name comes from the Japanese name list instead. The draw never
        stalls for want of a viewer.
      </div>

      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div class="sec">Summoned with bits</div>
      <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline">
          <span>hanae_dono &mdash; 2,500 bits</span><span class="note">a moment ago</span>
        </div>
        <div class="note">Comes in at training 6 of a capped 8. The cap is the whole of what money buys.</div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center">
          <div class="meter" style="height: 8px; flex-grow: 1"><i style="width: 75%"></i></div>
          <span class="note">6 / 8</span>
        </div>
        <div class="note" style="color: var(--warning)">
          She dies and loses limbs like anyone else. The donation buys a head start, never a life.
        </div>
        <div class="btn primary">Put her on the mat</div>
      </div>

      <div style="flex-grow: 1"></div>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px">
        <div class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1">Link Kick</div>
        <div class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1">Word filter</div>
        <div class="btn" style="flex-grow: 1">Leave the channel</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- the vote, with the window running -->
    <div class="panel" style="width: 470px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; border-color: #5a2e29">
      <div class="sec">The vote</div>
      <div class="card" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center">
        <div style="width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 2px; background: #1a1d26; border: 1px solid var(--warning); flex: none"></div>
        <div style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; min-width: 0">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between">
            <span>Saito Genji</span><span class="note">Ronin &middot; 7</span>
          </div>
          <div class="meter" style="height: 6px"><i style="width: 22%; background: var(--warning)"></i></div>
          <div class="note" style="color: var(--warning)">Right arm gone &middot; standing fell to 14%</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="note">
        He fell below the line in the fight that just ended. The window opened when the fight ended,
        never during it, and there is never a second vote at the same time.
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline">
          <span style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--pending)">41 s left</span>
          <span class="note">of 60</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meter" style="height: 10px"><i style="width: 68%; background: var(--pending)"></i></div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px">
        <div class="card" style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; border-color: var(--indigo)">
          <div class="note">Let him live</div>
          <div class="fig" style="color: var(--indigo)">88</div>
          <div class="note">type <span style="color: var(--ink)">!bushi</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; border-color: #5a2e29">
          <div class="note">Offer him the blade</div>
          <div class="fig" style="color: var(--warning)">134</div>
          <div class="note">type <span style="color: var(--ink)">!ronin</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="meter" style="height: 12px">
        <i style="width: 40%; background: var(--indigo)"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="note">
        222 votes cast. As it stands the crowd wants the blade. You may overrule them, and it costs
        standing when you do.
      </div>

      <div style="flex-grow: 1"></div>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div class="note">
        With no votes at all, the reading is made from his standing instead &mdash; the lower it is, the
        likelier the blade. Nothing waits on chat being there.
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px">
        <div class="btn">Let it stand</div>
        <div class="btn danger" style="flex-grow: 1">Overrule &mdash; he lives (&minus;6 standing)</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- the stream, and the one honest reading under it -->
    <div class="panel" style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-width: 0">
      <div class="sec">The stream</div>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4">
        <div><span style="color: var(--indigo)">kaede_77</span> <span class="note">!bushi</span> he kept his feet with one arm</div>
        <div><span style="color: var(--heading)">tollgate_dan</span> !ronin</div>
        <div><span style="color: var(--indigo)">hanae_dono</span> summoned a hero</div>
        <div><span style="color: var(--heading)">m_uesugi</span> that bind was clean</div>
        <div><span style="color: var(--indigo)">kaede_77</span> <span class="note">!no</span></div>
        <div class="note" style="padding-left: 2px">kaede_77 left the pool. Their vote still counts.</div>
        <div><span style="color: var(--heading)">nine_lives</span> !ronin, put him down</div>
        <div><span style="color: var(--indigo)">saburo_x</span> !bushi</div>
        <div><span style="color: var(--heading)">porters_guild</span> the fog cost her every shot</div>
        <div><span style="color: var(--indigo)">ren_stan</span> !bushi !bushi !bushi</div>
        <div class="note" style="padding-left: 2px">One vote a viewer. The rest were dropped.</div>
      </div>

      <div style="flex-grow: 1"></div>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div class="sec">The reading</div>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 15px">
          <span>Roused</span><span style="color: var(--heading)">reward &times;1.21</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meter" style="height: 10px">
          <i style="width: 68%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--indigo), var(--heading))"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="note">Bushi 68 &middot; Ronin 32</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px">
        <div class="note">With nobody watching</div>
        <div>This same bar is all you see &mdash; <span style="color: var(--ink)">displeased &times;0.82</span>, and no stream above it.</div>
        <div class="note">
          No invented usernames are printed. A made-up crowd cannot stand in for names the player knows.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
